OL,3,ANo 10 appears to backtrack on PM's
OL,4,Afreedom of movement referendum
OL,5,Asuggestion
OL,6,
OL,7,FDowning Street has appeared to
OL,8,Fbacktrack on the prime minister's
OL,9,Fsuggestion that he could call another
OL,10,Freferendum on whether to join the EU's
OL,11,Ffreedom of movement.
OL,13,FAsked earlier by broadcasters if he
OL,14,Fcould introduce freedom of movement
OL,15,Fwithout a referendum, Andy Burnham said
OL,16,F"no".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
