OL,3,ANo 10 appears to backtrack on PM's
OL,4,Afreedom of movement referendum
OL,5,Asuggestion
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut sources told the BBC no decision on
OL,8,Fthat has been made and the prime
OL,9,Fminister's deputy spokesperson later
OL,10,Fsaid the government was not going to
OL,11,F"get ahead" of how to consult the
OL,12,Fpublic.
OL,14,FBurnham has ruled out major changes to
OL,15,Fthe UK's relationship with the EU
OL,16,Fbefore the next general election but
OL,17,Fsays he wants start a conversation
OL,18,Fabout potential options.
